# Generated challenge build outputs only.
# `ctfbench build` emits a script challenge's artifacts into <challenge>/dist/
# (challenge-root level). Vendored source that happens to live under src/dist,
# bin/, or src/build/ is NOT ignored and must be committed.
/challenges/*/*/dist/
